WEBVTT

00:05.670 --> 00:07.370
Venus?

00:07.370 --> 00:12.240
Yup, the nurse was calling you Venus, Sana.

00:12.240 --> 00:13.610
What's Venus?

00:13.610 --> 00:16.110
She said that's what beautiful women are called.

00:16.110 --> 00:18.010
Listen to him, calling you beautiful!

00:18.010 --> 00:21.050
He's saying he wants to marry you!

00:21.050 --> 00:22.880
No, I'm not!

00:23.350 --> 00:27.490
I guess you haven't heard, Wataru.
We can't marry Sana.

00:27.490 --> 00:30.760
After all, we're all related like siblings.

00:30.760 --> 00:33.820
Related? Related, how?

00:34.330 --> 00:35.630
Oh, welcome back.

00:35.630 --> 00:37.690
That sure was a long check-up!

00:39.570 --> 00:42.800
Hey, we can't get married, right?

00:43.810 --> 00:45.670
No, we can't.

00:45.670 --> 00:49.180
After all, apart from Sana, none of us will survive.

00:49.180 --> 00:50.040
What?

00:53.280 --> 00:55.020
That's right.

00:55.020 --> 00:56.750
The only one left at the end...

00:56.750 --> 00:58.690
will be Sana.

00:58.690 --> 01:00.320
All alone...

01:00.320 --> 01:01.880
Sana...

01:02.220 --> 01:04.490
Guys? Where are you guys?

01:06.190 --> 01:07.660
Where did you go?

01:12.230 --> 01:14.000
She's not stabilizing.

01:14.000 --> 01:17.610
She's probably just having a bad dream.
There's no need to worry.

01:17.610 --> 01:19.730
Besides, her fever is coming down.

01:24.550 --> 01:28.950
All her numbers are normal.
She has no physical problems.

01:28.950 --> 01:30.920
By using her as the mother,

01:30.920 --> 01:35.860
it will be possible for the
fourth generation on to have purer genes.

01:35.860 --> 01:38.520
So will this clear all of our problems?

01:39.560 --> 01:43.660
Not yet. We've only gotten one of the keys.

01:46.000 --> 01:59.370
Sora ni toketa hane o matoi tobitate tsubasa de

01:46.000 --> 01:52.610
Cloaked in feathers melted into the sky

01:52.610 --> 01:59.380
Take flight on wings

02:13.720 --> 02:16.890
Morokute nigai kajitsu no you ni

02:13.730 --> 02:16.900
Like fragile but bitter fruit

02:16.890 --> 02:20.100
Hito no kokoro o miryou suru no

02:16.900 --> 02:20.110
It fascinates people's hearts

02:20.100 --> 02:23.200
Togi sumasareta shiroi yubi de

02:20.110 --> 02:21.610
The shadow that manipulates

02:21.610 --> 02:23.210
With sharpened fingers gleaming white

02:23.200 --> 02:26.370
Ayatsuru kage wa chi no kaori

02:23.210 --> 02:26.380
Smells of blood

02:26.370 --> 02:39.370
Shizumi aseta kodou o yobi samasu shi no sasayaki

02:26.380 --> 02:32.820
The whisper of Death

02:32.820 --> 02:39.380
That awakens fading heartbeats

02:40.350 --> 02:46.720
Sora ni toketa hane o matoi

02:40.360 --> 02:46.730
Cloaked in feathers melted into the sky

02:46.720 --> 02:52.960
Tobitatsu no wa gin no tsubasa

02:46.730 --> 02:52.970
Silver wings take flight

02:52.960 --> 02:59.440
Fukai kaze ni tsume o tatete

02:52.970 --> 02:59.440
Become the power that tears at deep winds

02:59.440 --> 03:09.170
Kirisaku chikara to nare

02:59.440 --> 03:09.180
With poised claws

03:10.160 --> 03:13.350
Brought to you by
BiG-GuY Fansubbing

03:14.920 --> 03:18.300
Episode 8
Loss

03:20.630 --> 03:23.800
Amazing. You can scan the Phantom lab completely.

03:23.800 --> 03:26.290
You can even pick up the interior
structure to some extent.

03:26.730 --> 03:29.370
This data... Don't tell me, it came from Logos?!

03:29.370 --> 03:32.740
Yeah, it's the surveillance data
from their high altitude airships.

03:32.740 --> 03:35.510
Don't underestimate the
intelligence skills of us pirates.

03:35.510 --> 03:36.950
Hacking like this is easy as...

03:36.950 --> 03:37.810
Gonza!
Hacking like this is easy as...

03:37.810 --> 03:38.900
Aye, sir.

03:39.050 --> 03:41.450
Don't go babbling about stuff you don't need to.

03:41.450 --> 03:41.550
Aye, sir.
Don't go babbling about stuff you don't need to.

03:41.550 --> 03:42.550
Aye, sir.

03:42.550 --> 03:44.110
You satisfied now?

03:44.490 --> 03:45.980
You've been very helpful.

03:46.590 --> 03:49.580
But, I have just one more favor.

03:59.930 --> 04:02.970
Jin and the other guys haven't been found yet?

04:02.970 --> 04:05.130
Once they start moving, we'll find them.

04:06.010 --> 04:09.680
I can't wait. The kid's already been caught.

04:09.680 --> 04:12.580
So the only thing left is to figure out
how to slaughter them.

04:13.450 --> 04:16.520
No. We have strict orders to capture them.

04:16.520 --> 04:18.920
Jin and the guys too? Why?

04:19.090 --> 04:22.060
I don't know. But whatever it is,
those are our orders.

04:23.320 --> 04:24.430
Diversionary tactics?

04:24.430 --> 04:27.960
More than likely, Sana is being held
in that laboratory.

04:27.960 --> 04:31.300
Naturally, they'll be on their guard,
and of course, Phantom too...

04:31.300 --> 04:34.240
So you want us to draw them out, huh?

04:34.240 --> 04:36.400
Man, I can't believe this.

04:36.400 --> 04:38.070
You make us find the lab,

04:38.070 --> 04:40.540
and then you want us to be a decoy
on top of that?

04:40.540 --> 04:45.980
I realize I'm asking too much,
but there really is no other way.

04:47.150 --> 04:48.350
What is it?

04:48.350 --> 04:49.820
Nothing.

04:49.820 --> 04:53.720
I'm just impressed by your audacity.

04:54.660 --> 04:59.690
I can see now why you can wear that thing.

04:59.690 --> 05:02.420
I, on the other hand, never want to
put that thing on again!

05:27.920 --> 05:30.430
This is D-4. We're being pushed back!

05:30.430 --> 05:31.950
Is our backup here yet?

05:32.490 --> 05:34.150
Headquarters! Where's our backup?

05:36.560 --> 05:38.030
Deploy!

05:54.680 --> 05:57.350
Platoons 6 and 7, signals lost.

05:57.350 --> 05:59.720
Platoons 13 to 18 have been annihilated.

05:59.720 --> 06:01.880
What's going on?! Find out, now!

06:17.000 --> 06:20.210
G-1 has gained control of Areas 48 and 49.

06:20.210 --> 06:22.980
G-2 has gained control of Areas 32 and 34.

06:22.980 --> 06:24.670
Enemy's main fleet retreating.

06:24.980 --> 06:27.180
All units switch to mop-up operations.

06:27.180 --> 06:27.720
18th armor platoon, head to point N-H.

06:27.720 --> 06:28.880
G-4, head to Area 27.
18th armor platoon, head to point N-H.

06:28.880 --> 06:30.250
G-3, go for recovery.
G-4, head to Area 27.
18th armor platoon, head to point N-H.

06:45.370 --> 06:48.960
Did you take part in the war
against the Asian Union?

06:49.270 --> 06:51.040
So you really were in Phantom.

06:51.040 --> 06:53.170
You don't feel it?

06:53.170 --> 06:55.710
That feeling of absolute terror and sadness...

06:55.710 --> 06:59.410
I can't trust a guy who can put that on
without feeling a thing.

06:59.410 --> 07:02.250
It's not that I don't feel anything...

07:02.250 --> 07:04.790
But you slowly get used to it.

07:04.790 --> 07:08.120
Only those with a high level of ability
can belong to Phantom.

07:10.690 --> 07:13.680
High ability? Don't make me laugh!

07:15.530 --> 07:19.830
What you're lacking is human emotion!

07:20.300 --> 07:23.830
You must know... what's inside those things...

07:31.510 --> 07:32.510
Hey, Jin.

07:32.510 --> 07:34.320
So you're gonna go save the princess?

07:34.320 --> 07:36.520
Of course, you're gonna take me too, right?

07:36.520 --> 07:38.650
Come on, Jin!

07:38.650 --> 07:39.880
Shut up!

07:41.890 --> 07:43.320
What was that for all of a sudden?

07:43.320 --> 07:44.790
You wanna fight?

07:44.790 --> 07:45.690
Hey!

07:45.690 --> 07:49.930
Let go of me, dammit!
What are you doing, Joe? Let me go!

07:50.260 --> 07:53.470
Very well, then. I understand.

07:53.470 --> 07:55.490
I agree to be your decoy.

07:57.670 --> 07:59.640
Damn, Jin's such a meanie.

07:59.910 --> 08:03.580
Come on, Joe, take me with you guys.

08:03.580 --> 08:06.340
I'm worried about the princess too, you know.

08:06.950 --> 08:08.680
Is it really for Sana?

08:10.690 --> 08:12.810
W-W-W-What do you mean?

08:14.020 --> 08:15.490
Who knows...

08:15.490 --> 08:16.720
Hey.

08:18.130 --> 08:20.090
Not you.

08:20.530 --> 08:22.590
Yeah, you.

08:22.930 --> 08:24.830
Take care of Sana, okay?

08:25.100 --> 08:27.260
You be the one to protect Sana.

08:28.200 --> 08:30.170
Don't give me that face.

08:31.370 --> 08:33.900
I'm asking you to do it.

08:35.140 --> 08:38.180
I see you shedding tears when
you put that thing on,

08:38.180 --> 08:40.240
which means I can trust you more.

08:57.430 --> 08:58.690
You know...

09:00.600 --> 09:02.590
No, it's nothing.

09:10.180 --> 09:11.850
Okay, begin dive.

09:11.850 --> 09:13.840
We'll now switch to strategic operations.

09:14.120 --> 09:16.650
We're up against Phantom.
Don't let your guard down!

09:16.650 --> 09:17.520
YEAH!

09:20.920 --> 09:22.320
Vice-Commander.

09:29.360 --> 09:31.500
This is the data from Airship 3?

09:31.500 --> 09:32.200
Yes.

09:32.200 --> 09:33.330
Is it that cave?

09:33.330 --> 09:36.100
Considering the amount of discharged energy,
there's no doubt it's the Ishin.

09:40.010 --> 09:40.940
Let's go, Joe.

09:40.940 --> 09:42.140
Yeah.

10:02.800 --> 10:05.290
Don't even think you can leave Gora behind!

10:10.710 --> 10:11.900
Phantom.

10:12.170 --> 10:15.400
They fell for the diversion. Just like we planned.

10:16.840 --> 10:20.140
Just as our report said, security seems pretty light.

10:21.480 --> 10:23.380
We're almost there. Let's hurry.

10:34.500 --> 10:35.530
What's the matter?

10:35.530 --> 10:37.200
Sana has been abducted.

10:37.200 --> 10:38.530
What?!

10:38.530 --> 10:41.500
I'll never be able to face OI' Man Chikura.

10:41.500 --> 10:43.400
Go, Toraji.

10:43.400 --> 10:46.370
If you go now, you can still use the secret path
to get out to the open sea.

10:46.370 --> 10:49.740
But the military is demanding that
the Ishin be handed over.

10:49.740 --> 10:51.580
I don't want to cause trouble for Satsuma.

10:51.910 --> 10:55.520
I never intended to hand you over in the first place.

10:55.520 --> 10:59.320
But in return, once things settle down,
you'd better come back here.

10:59.320 --> 11:00.810
I'll be waiting for you.

11:02.660 --> 11:04.020
Buichi...

11:04.390 --> 11:05.790
Captain.

11:06.030 --> 11:07.260
Oryo?

11:07.260 --> 11:09.200
So what's going on here?

11:09.200 --> 11:12.100
What's the big idea, playing decoy like this?

11:12.100 --> 11:15.630
Why do we need to go so far to save that girl?

11:16.570 --> 11:18.840
I want you to tell me the truth.

11:18.840 --> 11:21.540
After all, I've come this far with you
because I trusted you.

11:40.930 --> 11:42.420
All right!

11:42.830 --> 11:46.030
Now this armor is mine.
That was easy... super easy.

11:46.430 --> 11:48.600
When we hacked into the security here,

11:48.600 --> 11:51.070
we saw that the structure of
some of the rooms was unclear.

11:51.070 --> 11:53.270
Sana must be in one of those rooms.

12:15.760 --> 12:18.390
Jin... This is...

12:23.270 --> 12:26.870
So these are the children of the Vulcan Project...

12:27.170 --> 12:29.540
Vulcan Project?

12:29.540 --> 12:31.350
Prior to that defection incident,

12:31.350 --> 12:35.280
there were seven children with
special genes at the military lab.

12:36.120 --> 12:40.390
Sana and six boys. They were known as
the "Seven Children."

12:40.390 --> 12:44.260
What you see lined up here
are what remains of those boys.

12:44.260 --> 12:46.360
Why would they do something like this?

12:46.360 --> 12:47.830
Why?

12:48.160 --> 12:50.600
So that they can be inserted into the Gladiators.

12:52.230 --> 12:54.970
Children's nerve tissues?

12:54.970 --> 12:57.870
When they link with the pilot's nerves,

12:57.870 --> 13:00.670
only then will the Gladiator begin to move.

13:00.670 --> 13:05.210
But only a limited number of children
can be used for this.

13:05.210 --> 13:07.150
So Sana is one of them?

13:07.520 --> 13:09.920
No, Sana is special.

13:10.250 --> 13:12.020
By using her as the mother,

13:12.020 --> 13:15.280
it will be easier to mass-produce the nerve tissue.

13:15.590 --> 13:17.360
That makes me sick to my stomach.

13:17.360 --> 13:18.530
That's right.

13:18.530 --> 13:23.930
Memories of terror and sorrow from the children
who were taken apart remain in those armors.

13:24.060 --> 13:27.690
And those feelings can be felt through our nerves.

13:28.000 --> 13:31.230
We cannot allow them to produce any more of these.

13:34.410 --> 13:35.940
Have we been found?

13:35.940 --> 13:38.000
I don't know. But we gotta hurry.

13:44.320 --> 13:46.750
Somebody, stop this, please!

13:59.330 --> 14:00.500
Stop!

14:00.500 --> 14:04.060
A suspicious truck is driving wildly in Area East 8!

14:04.570 --> 14:08.370
This one was a decoy. I suspect that truck is too.

14:08.610 --> 14:11.250
The enemy has hacked Airship 3.

14:11.250 --> 14:13.300
And more than likely, they've hacked
the security at the lab too.

14:14.150 --> 14:15.550
Outside circuit cut off.

14:15.550 --> 14:17.550
Switching to independent system to start up again.

14:17.550 --> 14:19.890
Chance of restoring circuit is 56% .

14:19.890 --> 14:22.890
Intruders detected in Area 3-F, Section 4.

14:22.890 --> 14:24.020
Bringing them up on the monitor.

14:25.360 --> 14:27.550
Experimental unit, preparations
to deploy are complete.

14:27.730 --> 14:30.220
Intercept them at Point S-8.

14:30.500 --> 14:31.930
There's nobody around.

14:31.930 --> 14:33.990
Were we the ones to fall into a trap?

14:49.050 --> 14:51.210
What's this doing here?

14:52.620 --> 14:54.220
We're gonna have to leave and come back.

14:54.220 --> 14:55.990
Take a right down the pathway in the back!

14:55.990 --> 14:57.120
All right.

15:17.210 --> 15:18.710
Commander, this is just reckless.

15:18.710 --> 15:20.650
Riki has gone completely insane,

15:20.650 --> 15:23.220
and is operating the Gladiator on instinct alone!

15:23.220 --> 15:25.250
If he keeps this up,
the whole lab will be destroyed.

15:25.250 --> 15:28.220
Calm down. We should be able to get
some interesting data.

15:28.220 --> 15:29.350
What?

15:29.490 --> 15:32.290
How much of the Gladiator's potential
will be unlocked

15:32.290 --> 15:35.730
when the pilot has absolutely
no perception of fear...

15:38.570 --> 15:39.370
Jin!

15:39.370 --> 15:40.960
Break that window!

15:48.440 --> 15:49.570
Joe...

16:02.060 --> 16:03.060
Don't move!

16:03.060 --> 16:04.180
Crap...

16:06.190 --> 16:08.060
Gora, why?

16:08.430 --> 16:10.760
I-I came to rescue you!

17:02.320 --> 17:04.490
What is that power?

17:04.490 --> 17:07.150
It exceeds the limitations of a Gladiator...

17:07.150 --> 17:08.450
Cover me.

17:14.290 --> 17:15.780
I'm not lettin' you get away!

17:24.040 --> 17:25.670
I can't believe this.

17:25.670 --> 17:29.110
Even with a Gladiator's armor,
a direct hit like that should...

17:29.110 --> 17:31.610
All three units are above the test field.

17:31.610 --> 17:33.380
Blow up the dome and have them fall in.

17:33.380 --> 17:34.110
Y-Yes!

17:44.390 --> 17:45.930
You okay?

17:45.930 --> 17:46.960
No problem.

17:46.960 --> 17:48.220
Joe!

17:50.360 --> 17:53.500
All three units are now in the test field.

17:53.500 --> 17:55.540
Increase the load on the Gladiator.

17:55.540 --> 17:57.740
But that would increase the load on Riki too...

17:57.740 --> 17:59.070
I don't care.

18:07.680 --> 18:08.550
Damn!

18:08.550 --> 18:10.920
Wait, something's wrong.

18:19.130 --> 18:19.960
Wh-What is this?

18:19.960 --> 18:21.100
It's a load.

18:21.100 --> 18:23.620
An electromagnetic load is being put on us!

18:24.800 --> 18:27.230
Don't try to move, Joe.

18:27.230 --> 18:29.360
You'll damage the internal systems.

18:38.110 --> 18:40.550
Don't move! Don't move, Riki!

18:49.420 --> 18:51.260
The enemy gladiator is silenced.

18:51.260 --> 18:53.530
Unit 5 pilot's heart has stopped.

18:53.530 --> 18:54.590
Retrieve them.

18:59.770 --> 19:01.500
What on Earth happened?

19:03.170 --> 19:04.770
Riki...

19:04.770 --> 19:07.300
He issued the order knowing this would happen?

19:15.220 --> 19:17.310
So you've finally come to.

19:19.150 --> 19:22.180
How unpleasant. You smell of Revinus.

19:27.260 --> 19:29.760
Where's Sana? What did you do with Sana?

19:29.760 --> 19:31.460
Relax.

19:36.270 --> 19:37.040
Sana!

19:37.040 --> 19:39.010
You certainly took a roundabout way

19:39.010 --> 19:43.310
of carrying out your mission of
bringing Venus to me, Jin Tsurusawa.

19:43.810 --> 19:46.240
Is your goal to conquer the military?

19:46.510 --> 19:50.480
Venus is a vital part of mass-producing Gladiators.

19:50.480 --> 19:54.290
And to the military, mass production
is an overriding necessity.

19:54.290 --> 19:57.220
What right do you have to refute that?

19:57.220 --> 20:01.900
At least I'm not doing this
out of self-interest like you.

20:01.900 --> 20:02.900
What?

20:02.900 --> 20:07.420
I'm saying that you are the one
who killed Nobuto, Sana's father.

20:13.440 --> 20:15.570
I see you've done your homework.

20:16.540 --> 20:19.670
You're exactly right, Drake.

20:22.550 --> 20:26.380
Oh, I see that she can hear us out here.

20:26.620 --> 20:28.060
That was careless of me.

20:28.060 --> 20:29.120
Jin...

20:29.120 --> 20:30.990
Jin, what do you mean?

20:30.990 --> 20:33.150
You killed Sana's father?

20:33.730 --> 20:36.400
It's nothing you need to worry about, Joe.

20:36.400 --> 20:40.230
All you had to do was just do what I asked you to.

20:41.300 --> 20:44.070
I'll make a deal with you, Drake.

20:44.070 --> 20:45.470
A deal?

20:45.470 --> 20:48.880
You took the trouble to capture me alive.
So you must realize, right?

20:48.880 --> 20:52.410
Yes, I possess the crucial thing.

20:52.410 --> 20:58.020
However, unfortunately, I have neither the
technology nor the facilities to use it effectively.

20:58.020 --> 20:59.990
Are you saying you want to join hands?

20:59.990 --> 21:03.590
Who knows? We may share
similar goals in the future.

21:03.590 --> 21:05.160
Don't you think so?

21:05.160 --> 21:06.820
Jin, you...

21:07.030 --> 21:13.160
I loved you, and Sana too.
You were so pure and reasonable...

21:13.270 --> 21:14.570
and foolish.

21:14.570 --> 21:16.870
Jin, I trusted you.

21:16.870 --> 21:20.570
Sana did too! She trusted you! That's why...

21:20.570 --> 21:23.670
You're unusually talkative today.

21:28.150 --> 21:29.740
Joe...

21:33.220 --> 21:37.350
I don't really like guys who talk too much.

21:38.160 --> 21:42.230
Jin. You're not serious, are you?

21:42.230 --> 21:46.760
You've done a good job so far.
But you've already served your purpose.

22:01.950 --> 22:04.850
This is goodbye, Joe.

22:25.170 --> 22:29.680
Nagai kioku no hate ni

22:25.170 --> 22:29.640
If at the end of our long memory

22:29.640 --> 22:35.480
Time will tear us apart

22:29.680 --> 22:35.510
Toki ga bokura o wakatsu nara

22:37.520 --> 22:44.160
If at the end of my sweet memory with you

22:37.550 --> 22:44.190
Kimi to amai kioku no hate ni

22:44.160 --> 22:50.460
You and I become one again

22:44.190 --> 22:50.500
Mata bokura hitotsu nara

22:50.460 --> 22:57.640
From a quietly stretched arm's length away

22:50.500 --> 22:57.670
Sotto te nobashita kyori kara

22:57.640 --> 23:02.340
I will search for the meaning

22:57.670 --> 23:02.380
lmi o sagasu kara

23:02.340 --> 23:08.180
Can you hear it? The words dance in midair

23:02.380 --> 23:08.220
Kikoeru? Kotoba ga chuu ni mau

23:08.180 --> 23:13.990
We shall meet when our wish is granted

23:08.220 --> 23:14.020
Kanaeta toki ni deau

23:13.990 --> 23:17.660
Leaving only their reverse behind

23:14.020 --> 23:17.690
Reverse dake nokoshite

23:17.660 --> 23:21.060
The torn words

23:17.690 --> 23:21.090
Chigireta kotoba

23:21.060 --> 23:27.190
Blurred time and light

23:21.090 --> 23:27.230
Kasureta jikan to hikari

23:29.370 --> 23:33.700
I have found them now

23:29.400 --> 23:33.740
lma, mitsuketa kara

23:35.230 --> 23:46.690
